{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50150","headline":"杂诗（伯三七七一。下同） · 乔备","name":"杂诗（伯三七七一。下同）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蹔借金鎚秤，衔涕诉恩波。\n君情将妾怨，称取谓谁多？\n秋吹绫纨索[一]，（「绫」原卷作「淩」。\n）空闺生网罗。\n不期《流水引》，翻作《断肠歌》？\n（[一]俞云：「『绫纨索』三字不可解，必有误字。\n按下句句法，『绫』字当是一个动词，疑当作『陵纨素』。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔备","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}